= entry .ChartPalette   the colours a chart draws with, named by the role each plays rather than by hue
-   detail
+   detail

-       The series ramp (cycled when there are more series than colours), the axes and their
-       gradations, the grid, the lettering, and — as a `Palette` — the background and
-       foreground. One style renders under any palette. The no-import default is `.slate`, a
-       light palette with eight distinguishable hues; `palettes.solarizedDarkChartPalette` and
-       `palettes.solarizedLightChartPalette` are chosen by import, and `.of` makes one from an
-       iridescence `Theme`.
